application "Scheduled Worker" is service

model Job
field name is text
that is all

controller Work
action initialize
set runs to 0
that is all

action "run scheduled work"
set runs to runs plus 1
that is all

when application starts
run action initialize
show view "status"
that is all

every 1 millisecond
run action "run scheduled work"
that is all

every 1 millisecond
run action "run scheduled work"
that is all
that is all

view "status"
heading "Scheduled worker"
text "Waiting for scheduled work."
that is all
